t oval rug maybe adds warm touch; but not requested. Okay optional. Avoid too many details.\n- baseboard.\n\nBackground embellishments:\n- Right side maybe wall shelf? If empty wall behind table right, could add subtle framed hops print? But user says no people, fine. Maybe small framed botanical print x=900 y=150 with muted sage leaves. But flat illustration, warm. Does it distract? Could add low-key \"kitchen\" by hanging a simple clock or shelf. Morning light and table enough. A wall clock could show 7:15 and support morning. But requirement morning sunlight, okay. However \"MONDAY\" on mug reinforces morning. A small clock at upper right with \"7:15\"? Flat. We can add a simple round wall clock in warm brass, muted. But possibly too detailed. The composition might have blank right top. Add framed print \"KITCHEN\" would introduce text but fine. Better: a wall shelf at upper right with ceramic pitcher and canisters, but might count extra objects? Not restricted except exact apples. Could include a small potted plant, but plants can be nice. Yet user's ask is minimal. I think adding subtle wall texture and a small framed botanical print makes it feel designed. But an apple in artwork could violate exact three red apples if red. Use botanical eucalyptus in frame. Hmm.\n\nMaybe no shelf, but put a simple sunlight patch on wall and a hanging plant? Keep minimal.\n\nLet's focus on tabletop scene. Main quality important.\n\nObjects:\nApples on left. Create defs with apple group symbol? We need exactly three. Use group each with individual offset/scales. Apple shape one path:\nM 0 -30 C -18 -46 -42 -27 -42 -5 C -42 22 -21 40 0 32 C 21 40 42 22 42 -5 C 42 -27 18 -46 0 -30 Z maybe central top indentation. Better:\nM 0 -32 C -8 -25 -18 -28 -25 -22 C -39 -10 -41 18 -23 31 C -12 39 -4 40 0 34 C 4 40 12 39 23 31 C 41 18 39 -10 25 -22 C 18 -28 8 -25 0 -32 Z\nwith fill #b8473e. But apple silhouette at top should have dip: The path starts at top center? Let's make two lobes:\nM 